--- pr_process_steps
step | task | description | tools | output
1 | Read PR Template | Extract sections and guide comments | git, file_search | template_structure
2 | Analyze Changes | Get diff and commit history | git diff, git log | changes_summary
3 | Fill Template | Generate content per section | git analysis | filled_template
4 | Create Title | Generate title with Conventional Commits | commit_rules | pr_title
5 | Format Output | Generate markdown file with all content | markdown | final_pr_file

--- pr_template_sections
section | field_name | purpose | source_data | expected_format
1 | What problem is this solving? | Problem description | Git commits & analysis | Plain text summary
2 | How to test it? | Testing instructions | Modified files & features | Step-by-step list
3 | Screenshots or example usage | Visual reference | Type of change | Image or N/A
4 | Describe alternatives you've considered | Alternative solutions | Commit history | Text or No aplica
5 | Related to / Depends on | Issue tracking | Commit references | Issue links or None
6 | How does this PR make you feel? | Team engagement | Giphy suggestion | Gif link or emoji

--- conventional_commit_types
type | meaning | version_impact | example_scope | description
feat | New feature | MINOR | api, ui, auth | Introduces new functionality
fix | Bug patch | PATCH | button, form, login | Fixes a bug in codebase
docs | Documentation | NONE | readme, guide, api | Documentation changes only
style | Code style | NONE | formatting, linting | Does not affect logic
refactor | Code restructure | NONE | utils, services | Improves code quality
perf | Performance | PATCH | api, rendering | Performance improvements
test | Test additions | NONE | coverage, e2e | Adds or updates tests
chore | Maintenance | NONE | deps, build, ci | Build, deps, config changes
ci | CI/CD changes | NONE | pipeline, github | CI/CD configuration
build | Build changes | NONE | webpack, babel | Build system changes

--- pr_title_examples
type_scope | example_title | problem_solved | use_case
feat(api) | feat(api): Add user authentication endpoint | Missing auth endpoint | New API feature
fix(ui) | fix(ui): Correct button alignment in mobile view | Misaligned buttons | Bug in UI
test(coverage) | test(coverage): Improve service tests to 87% | Low test coverage | Quality improvement
refactor(services) | refactor(services): Restructure user service | Complex service logic | Code maintainability
docs(readme) | docs(readme): Update API documentation | Outdated docs | Documentation
perf(api) | perf(api): Optimize query response time | Slow API responses | Performance issue

--- data_mapping_pr_to_content
analysis_type | git_command | extracted_data | maps_to_pr_section | priority
Commit Messages | git log origin/master...HEAD | Changes summary | What problem is this solving? | high
File Changes | git diff --name-only | Modified files | How to test it? | high
Diff Details | git diff origin/master...HEAD | Code changes | How to test it? | high
Branch Name | git branch --show-current | Feature/fix pattern | PR Title type detection | high
References | git log --grep | Issue IDs & links | Related to / Depends on | medium
Commit Count | git log --oneline | Number of changes | Complexity estimation | low

--- benefits_vs_markdown
aspect | markdown_format | toon_format | improvement
readability | Readable | Highly readable | Same
file_size | ~2.5KB | ~0.8KB | -68%
tokens_needed | ~1200 | ~280 | -77%
parsing_speed | Slow | Fast | 4x faster
llm_processing | High cost | Low cost | 77% savings
maintainability | Manual edits | Easy to update | Cells based
